  "product": {
    "id": 8582892880021,
    "title": "Aaloo Sev | आलू सेव | Crispy Potato Indian Namkeen Snack",
    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"729\">Relish the crispy, savory taste of <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"492\">Aloo Sev</strong>, a traditional <strong>indian</strong><strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"534\"> namkeen snack</strong> handcrafted by <strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"570\">Bhagvat Prasadam</strong>. Made from <strong data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"610\">premium quality potatoes</strong> and perfectly seasoned with aromatic spices, this <strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"683\">spicy Indian snack</strong> delivers a satisfying crunch in every bite.</p>\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"994\">Perfect as <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"814\">tea-time namkeen, mixture namkeen, Diwali snacks, or festive gifting</strong>, our Aloo Sev combines <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"888\">authentic flavor, tradition, and affordability</strong>. Experience the joy of <strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"942\">traditional Indian namkeen</strong> with every bite of this <strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"991\">fresh, crunchy snack</strong>.</p>",
